cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Reproducibility Pack for the review of "Water-bearing structures in
  tunnel engineering based on high-precision 3-D advanced geological
  prediction TEM": reference denoising pipeline, reproducible Table 2,
  Monte-Carlo robustness and additive-noise control
message: >-
  Review-side reference implementation built solely from
  manuscript-disclosed parameters (synthetic data; no forward/inversion
  code). Companion to the R4 review report and the terminal-round
  revision task book, 2026-09-30.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Review-side reproducibility working group"
    affiliation: "manuscript review workflow"
identifiers:
  - type: other
    value: "tem_repro_pack_v3"
    description: "Pack version 3 (2026-09-30); v2 and v1 same day"
repository-code: >-
  Distributed as an email attachment; to be superseded by the authors'
  own versioned DOI archive (review task T2).
keywords:
  - transient electromagnetic (TEM)
  - wavelet denoising
  - reproducibility
  - SNR/RMSE audit
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2026-09-30"
